#
# One rule over one property. The paired JSON specs in this directory are valid JSON written in the
# shapes libyaml's scanner does not accept -- a member name past its simple-key limit, a line break
# before a member's colon, a raw control character inside a string -- which the reader rewrites
# before it reads them, so each run is about the document being read as written, and the rule only
# has to be decidable.
#
rule a_is_one { A == 1 }
